### ============================================
### BUS ROUTING API TESTS
### ============================================

### Health Check - CSA Transit Router Status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/test
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------
### VALID ROUTING REQUESTS
### --------------------------------------------

### Valid Route: Linz Hauptbahnhof → Leonding Meixnerkreuzung (morning)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Valid Route: Same route, different time (afternoon)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=14:00:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Valid Route: No transfers allowed
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Valid Route: Maximum transfers (5)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=5
Accept: application/json

### Valid Route: Early morning departure
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=06:00:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Valid Route: Late evening departure
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=22:00:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------
### VARIED STOP COMBINATIONS (Direct routes only - no transfers supported yet)
### --------------------------------------------

### LONGEST DIRECT ROUTE: Biegung (North) → Traun Schloss (South) - ~10.9km on tram 4
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.31246978&lon_a=14.28182961&lat_b=48.21850757&lon_b=14.23845895&departure_time=08:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### LONGEST DIRECT ROUTE (reverse): Traun Schloss → Biegung on tram 4
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.21869312&lon_a=14.23844098&lat_b=48.31239211&lon_b=14.28227877&departure_time=08:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Long route: Mühlkreisbahnhof → Traun Schloss (~10.8km) on tram 4
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.31191416&lon_a=14.28033841&lat_b=48.21850757&lon_b=14.23845895&departure_time=09:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Tram 1 full line: Auwiesen → JKU Universität (~9km, 42min)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.24894624&lon_a=14.30877907&lat_b=48.33485694&lon_b=14.32035835&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Tram 3: Hauptplatz → Trauner Kreuzung
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.30627394&lon_a=14.28623136&lat_b=48.23385183&lon_b=14.23491959&departure_time=10:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Central city: Taubenmarkt → Goethekreuzung
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.30387188&lon_a=14.28827952&lat_b=48.29576858&lon_b=14.29226804&departure_time=11:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Short tram hop: Remise Kleinmünchen → Wimmerstraße (tram 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.25834883&lon_a=14.32122972&lat_b=48.26135108&lon_b=14.3198553&departure_time=12:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### Suburb: Simonystraße → Scharlinz (tram 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.25590265&lon_a=14.32246041&lat_b=48.26842539&lon_b=14.31648662&departure_time=14:00:00&max_transfers=0
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------
### EDGE CASES - SHOULD RETURN 404 (No Route Found)
### --------------------------------------------

### No Route: Departure time too late (no service)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=23:59:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### No Route: Coordinates far from any stops
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=47.0&lon_a=15.0&lat_b=47.1&lon_b=15.1&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### --------------------------------------------
### VALIDATION ERRORS - SHOULD RETURN 400
### --------------------------------------------

### Missing Parameter: lat_a
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: lon_a
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: lat_b
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: lon_b
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: departure_time
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: max_transfers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lat_a out of range (> 90)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=95&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lat_a out of range (< -90)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=-95&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lon_a out of range (> 180)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=200&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lon_a out of range (< -180)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=-200&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: Not a number
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=abc&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Time Format: Missing seconds
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Time Format: Single digit hour
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=8:30:00&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Time Format: Not a time
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=morning&max_transfers=2
Accept: application/json

### Invalid max_transfers: Negative
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=-1
Accept: application/json

### Invalid max_transfers: Too high (> 5)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=10
Accept: application/json

### Invalid max_transfers: Not a number
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bus/route?lat_a=48.29083784&lon_a=14.29149548&lat_b=48.26261292&lon_b=14.25910224&departure_time=08:30:00&max_transfers=two
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### WEATHER API TESTS
### ============================================

### Valid Weather Request: Linz
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=48.3069&lon=14.2858
Accept: application/json

### Valid Weather Request: Vienna
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=48.2082&lon=16.3738
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: lat
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lon=14.2858
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: lon
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=48.3069
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lat out of range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=100&lon=14.2858
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: lon out of range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=48.3069&lon=200
Accept: application/json

### Invalid Coordinate: Not a number
GET http://localhost:3000/api/weather/forecast?lat=invalid&lon=14.2858
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### PLACES/GEOCODING API TESTS
### ============================================

### Valid Place: Linz
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode?place=Linz
Accept: application/json

### Valid Place: Specific Address
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode?place=Hauptplatz%201%2C%20Linz
Accept: application/json

### Valid Place: Leonding
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode?place=Leonding
Accept: application/json

### Missing Parameter: place
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode
Accept: application/json

### Empty Place Parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode?place=
Accept: application/json

### Non-existent Place
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places/geocode?place=ThisPlaceDoesNotExist12345
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### UNIFIED SMART DEVICES API TESTS (Requires Auth Cookie)
### ============================================

### List all KZ West smart devices & live cached state
GET http://localhost:3000/api/devices
Accept: application/json

### Switch KZ West Ceiling Light ON (0/0/203)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/ceiling-light
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "on": true
}

### Dim Arthur Desk Light to 75% (0/0/96 + 0/0/95)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/desk-light
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brightness": 75
}

### Set KZ West Room LEDs RGB & Brightness
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/room-leds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rgb": "#00ff66",
  "brightness": 80
}

### Switch KZ West Outlet OFF (0/0/30)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/outlet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "on": false
}

### Move West Window Blind DOWN (0/1/14)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/blind-west
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blindAction": "down"
}

### Stop West Window Blind (0/1/15)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/blind-west
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blindAction": "stop"
}

### Move All KZ West Blinds UP (0/1/28)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/blinds-all
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blindAction": "up"
}

### Adjust All KZ West Blind Slat Angles to 60% (0/1/36 step pulse)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/devices/blinds-all
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slatAngle": 60
}

### Subscribe to Real-Time Smart Device State SSE Stream
GET http://localhost:3000/api/devices/events
Accept: text/event-stream


